  "#61ccd2c37e": {
    "hash": "61ccd2c37e",
    "en": "From the deep halls of Khaz Modan come the Demolition Squads, masters of explosives who can shatter walls or stone bulwarks alike. Reckless and daring, they plant their charges and escape the blast with fearless precision in service to the Alliance.|nSingle use. Particularly effective against buildings.|n|n|cffffcc00Attacks land units and trees.|r",
    "tr": "From the deep halls of Khaz Modan come the Подрывной отрядs, masters of explosives who can shatter walls or stone bulwarks alike. Reckless and daring, they plant their charges and escape the blast with Страхless precision in service to the Alliance.|nSingle use. Particularly effective against Построитьings.|n|n|cffffcc00Атакаs land units and trees.|r"
  },
  "#b1dc374c38": {
